          "whyItMatters": "Senior investors and policymakers must monitor widening global imbalances, particularly the deteriorating US net international investment position, as they signal potential structural shifts in capital flows and currency valuations. Understanding these adjustment scenarios is crucial for assessing tail risks in foreign exchange and sovereign debt markets.",
