      "example": "NDTL ₹1,000 Cr, SLR 18% → ₹180 Cr must be held in G-Secs/gold/cash.",
      "whyItMatters": "Creates captive buyer for G-Secs, suppressing yields. Enables government to finance deficit at lower rates."
